# 插件目录

此目录用于放置外部插件文件。

## 插件示例

创建 `my_plugin.py`:

```python
from services.quality.dimensions.base import DimensionEvaluator
from services.quality.registry import register_evaluator

@register_evaluator("my_plugin_evaluator")
class MyPluginEvaluator(DimensionEvaluator):
    """插件评估器。"""

    dimension_name = "my_plugin_evaluator"

    def evaluate(self, data, rules=None, config=None):
        # 实现评估逻辑
        pass
```

## 加载插件

```python
from services.quality.plugin_loader import PluginLoader

loader = PluginLoader()
loaded = loader.load_from_directory("plugins/")
print(loaded)
```
